@startuml
!define CREAM #FAF6EB
!define RED #BA3143
!define LIME #D8F24B
!define INK #291B1D
skinparam backgroundColor CREAM
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor INK
skinparam ArrowColor RED
skinparam actorBorderColor RED
skinparam actorFontColor INK
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor CREAM
skinparam usecaseBorderColor RED
skinparam rectangleBorderColor RED
skinparam noteBackgroundColor LIME
skinparam noteBorderColor RED
left to right direction
title Marathon Wrapped — user goals (SRS V3)
actor Runner
actor Organizer
actor "Strava service\nExternal, opt-in" as Strava
rectangle "Marathon Wrapped prototype" {
  usecase "View my personal race recap\nUR-F1, UR-F7" as Recap
  usecase "Understand my split performance\nUR-F2" as Insights
  usecase "Connect Strava for extra detail\nUR-F3" as Connect
  usecase "Disconnect Strava\nUR-F4" as Disconnect
  usecase "View my matched race photos\nUR-F5" as Photos
  usecase "Export / share my recap image\nUR-F6" as Export
  usecase "View event results\nUR-F8" as Results
  usecase "Manage hero-runner demo data\nCreate / update / replace\nUR-F9" as Manage
}
Runner -- Recap
Runner -- Insights
Runner -- Connect
Runner -- Disconnect
Runner -- Photos
Runner -- Export
Organizer -- Results
Organizer -- Manage
Strava -- Connect
note bottom of Recap
  DNF has an honest recap with no invented finish values.
  Optional metrics and photos are not prerequisites.
  Alternative outcomes are specified in FS-01–FS-08.
end note
@enduml
